{"text": "Long ago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Elephant did not have a trunk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had only a short, blackish nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As big as a boot. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He could wiggle it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he could not pick up anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then there was a young Elephants Child. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he was full of curiosity. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was always asking questions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About everything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked his tall aunt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Ostrich. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why her tail feathers grew that way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked his tall uncle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giraffe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What made his skin spotty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked his broad aunt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Hippopotamus. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why her eyes were red. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Each time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His relatives were cross. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And gave him a little spank. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One fine morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked a new question. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What does the Crocodile have for dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everybody said, Hush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a loud and frightened voice.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "o", "n", "g", " ", "a", "g", "o", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "E", "l", "e", "p", "h", "a", "n", "t", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "a", " ", "t", "r", "u", "n", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "h", "o", "r", "t", ",", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", "i", "s", "h", " ", "n", "o", "s", "e", 